  "title.t90a.blueprint.t90a": "T-90A Main Battle Tank",
  "description.t90a.blueprint.t90a": "The T-90A is the improved T-90, with a welded turret and a 1,000 hp V-92S2 diesel. Its 125 mm 2A46M-5 smoothbore is fed by a carousel autoloader holding 22 ready rounds and can fire up to seven rounds per minute. The gunner's 1G46 sight combines laser rangefinding with a missile guidance channel, while the commander has the TKN-4S day/night sight. Kontakt-5 explosive reactive armour covers the hull front and flanks and both sides of the turret, the turret modules being removable as complete blocks. Three crew, about 46.5 t combat weight, 60 km/h on roads and roughly 500 km of range.",
